        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Thorbjorn N. Mohn, Michael E. Bauman\n- Organizations: the American institution led by Thorbjorn N. Mohn, the place where Michael E. Bauman taught\n- Roles: president, Lecturer and Tutor in Renaissance theology and Literature\n- Topics: institutional founding dates, student exchange or study destinations\n\nFacts:\n- The American institution that Thorbjorn N. Mohn served as president was founded in 1874.\n- Michael E. Bauman was a Lecturer and Tutor in Renaissance theology and Literature at another institution for eight years.\n- The American institution led by Thorbjorn N. Mohn has sent students to the institution where Michael E. Bauman taught.",
